{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L6--7 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: align_marked_bar_tips\n- L10--11 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: route_telescoping_arm_through_gap\n- L14--16 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: align_marked_bar_tips, park_crossing_telescopic_barriers\n- L19--22 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: align_marked_bar_tips, park_crossing_telescopic_barriers\n- L25--28 `def play_level_5(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_s5i5_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_nxg8j0d`\n- L31--34 `def play_level_6(env): # Recovered from verified proposer path artifact: checkpoint.json+/Users/sasha/gkm/output/arc_agi3_gpt61_zero_seed_20261116T144404Z/source/arc/crack_lab/runs/scratch/gkm_legs_ws_s5i5_arc_agi3_n0_fresh_frontier_hiku9hh`\n\n## legs.py\n- L5--69 `def align_marked_bar_tips(env, max_moves=40):` — Click paired controls to bring coloured bar tips onto cross marks.; calls: abs, all, arr, connected_components, distance, enumerate, int, min, range, safe_step, +1\n- L72--112 `def park_crossing_telescopic_barriers(env, max_moves=60, stages=None):` — Park coupled horizontal/vertical barriers outside crossing tip lanes.; calls: any, arr, connected_components, int, len, min, range, safe_step, sorted\n- L115--194 `def route_telescoping_arm_through_gap(env, max_moves=100):` — Route a right/up/right/down arm via clear, grid-aligned bends.; calls: all, any, arr, clear, connected_components, enumerate, int, len, min, range, +5\n- L197--303 `def stage_rotating_arm_through_gap(env, max_states=80):` — Turn a short three-link arm left/down/right, then enter a wall gap.; calls: abs, align_marked_bar_tips, all, any, arr, connected_components, deque, distance, int, len, +6\n\n## perception.py\n- L23--36 `class Blob:`; calls: dataclass\n- L39--40 `def arr(frame) -> np.ndarray:`\n- L43--45 `def color_counts(frame) -> Dict[int, int]:`; calls: arr, int, zip\n- L48--79 `def connected_components(frame, colors: Optional[Iterable[int]] = None, min_area: int = 1) -> List[Blob]:`; calls: Blob, arr, int, len, max, min, range, sorted, sum\n- L82--89 `def block_signatures(frame, cell: int = 4) -> Dict[Tuple[int, int], Tuple[int, ...]]:` — Partition a frame into fixed cells and return each cell's color signature.; calls: arr, int, range, sorted, tuple\n- L92--110 `def object_candidates(frame, cell: int = 4, min_area: int = 4) -> List[dict]:` — A compact, game-agnostic object list from color components and cell signatures.; calls: arr, block_signatures, connected_components\n- L113--123 `def frame_delta(before, after) -> dict:`; calls: arr, int, len, zip\n- L126--156 `def normalize_public_action(action):` — Validate one public key or coordinate action without touching ``env``.; calls: ValueError, any, int, isinstance, len, range\n- L159--166 `def safe_step(env, action):` — Validate locally, then apply one public key or coordinate action.; calls: isinstance, normalize_public_action\n- L169--182 `def action_deltas(env, actions=None) -> Dict[object, dict]:` — Compare valid cloned actions; bare ACTION6 is never sent to the arena.; calls: arr, frame_delta, normalize_public_action, safe_step, tuple\n- L185--194 `def replay(env, actions: Sequence):`; calls: normalize_public_action, safe_step, tuple\n- L197--205 `def path_result(env, actions: Sequence[int]) -> dict:`; calls: bool, color_counts, int, len, object_candidates, replay\n- L208--213 `def changed_signature(env, actions: Sequence[int], cell: int = 4):`; calls: block_signatures, replay, set, sorted\n- L216--243 `def bounded_bfs(env, goal_fn, actions=None, key_fn=None, max_states: int = 20000, max_depth: int = 80):` — BFS